      style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
    >
      This is the official website of Nishikino, a creator and influencer showcasing my activities and works.<br>
      Here you can explore an overview of my creations and projects, centered on Japanese castles and historic architecture recreated in games and digital spaces.
    </p>

    <p
