        mt-3
        text-xs
        leading-6
        text-neutral-700
        sm:text-sm
        sm:leading-7
      "
      style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
    >
      In addition to my works, this site brings together my profile, creative process, research and historical references,
      video and social media activities, achievements, and information about commissions and collaborations.
